00:36.177 --> 00:43.881
The door's shut. The air is thick. A man in a

00:44.141 --> 00:45.402
uniform.

00:47.582 --> 00:52.186
My blood runs cold, my hands go numb. I can't feel

00:52.506 --> 00:57.791
my own chair. He's holding out a folded sheet.

00:57.971 --> 01:04.216
This isn't fair. He looks at me. His face is grim.

01:06.318 --> 01:09.661
